1\n\n### Issue description\n\nI using `script.get_script_method_list()` in my plugin to read function definitions i need for my function doubling implementaion.\nThe function `static func _static_init() -> void:` provides a wrong return value usage.\n```\nvar return_descriptor: Dictionary = descriptor[\"return\"]\nvar type: int = return_descriptor[\"type\"]\nvar usage: int = return_descriptor[\"usage\"]\n```\nUsage is  `PROPERTY_USAGE_NIL_IS_VARIANT` where be wrong a void function can't be return a Variant.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a scene and attach this script to show the problem:\n```\nextends Node\n\nclass ClassWithStaticFunc extends RefCounted:\n\n\tstatic func _static_init() -> void:\n\t\tprints(\"_static_init called\")\n\n\n\tstatic func _static_init2() -> void:\n\t\tprints(\"_static_init2 called\")\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar c := ClassWithStaticFunc.new()\n\tvar script: GDScript = c.get_script()\n\tfor descriptor in script.get_script_method_list():\n\n\t\tprints(descriptor[\"name\"])\n\t\tvar return_descriptor: Dictionary = descriptor[\"return\"]\n\t\tvar type: int = return_descriptor[\"type\"]\n\t\tvar usage: int = return_descriptor[\"usage\"]\n\t\tprints(\"return type: \", type)\n\t\tprints(\"usage: \", usage)\n\t\tprints()\n\n\tawait get_tree().physics_frame\n\tget_tree().quit()\n```\n\nThe output is\n```\n_static_init called\n_static_init\nreturn type:  0\nusage:  131072\n\n_static_init2\nreturn type:  0\nusage:  0\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"